#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:1
msgid "Filesystem, state, and safety"
msgstr "Sistema de archivos, estado y seguridad"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:3
msgid ""
"The Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria (AEAT) is the external "
"tax authority referenced by the filing and live-read boundaries on this "
"page."
msgstr ""
"La Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria (AEAT) es la autoridad "
"tributaria externa a la que se refieren los límites de presentación y de "
"lectura en vivo de esta página."

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:6
msgid "Local state layout"
msgstr "Disposición del estado local"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:8
msgid ""
"`CADRUMO_LOCAL_STORAGE_ROOT` selects the root of Cadrumo-owned local "
"state. The default depends on how Cadrumo runs:"
msgstr ""
"`CADRUMO_LOCAL_STORAGE_ROOT` selecciona la raíz del estado local "
"propiedad de Cadrumo. El valor por defecto depende de cómo se ejecute "
"Cadrumo:"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Platform"
msgstr "Plataforma"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Default storage root"
msgstr "Raíz de almacenamiento por defecto"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "`%LOCALAPPDATA%/cadrumo/storage`"
msgstr "`%LOCALAPPDATA%/cadrumo/storage`"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "`$XDG_DATA_HOME/cadrumo/storage`, or `~/.local/share/cadrumo/storage`"
msgstr "`$XDG_DATA_HOME/cadrumo/storage`, o `~/.local/share/cadrumo/storage`"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "`~/Library/Application Support/cadrumo/storage`"
msgstr "`~/Library/Application Support/cadrumo/storage`"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:17
msgid ""
"The root is the same whether Cadrumo runs from a source checkout or an "
"installed distribution. Running from a checkout does not move it: set "
"`CADRUMO_LOCAL_STORAGE_ROOT` to put the tree inside the checkout."
msgstr "La raíz es la misma tanto si Cadrumo se ejecuta desde un repositorio de código como desde una distribución instalada. Ejecutarlo desde un repositorio no la cambia: defina `CADRUMO_LOCAL_STORAGE_ROOT` para situar el árbol dentro del repositorio."

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:21
msgid ""
"Cadrumo creates the root and the directories below it when a command that"
" uses them runs. The state-free surfaces (`--help`, `--version`, and a "
"bare invocation) do not create anything, so browsing the command tree "
"leaves no state behind."
msgstr "Cadrumo crea la raíz y los directorios que dependen de ella cuando se ejecuta un comando que los utiliza. Las superficies sin estado (`--help`, `--version` y la invocación simple) no crean nada, así que explorar el árbol de comandos no deja ningún estado."

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:26
msgid ""
"Profile state is bucket-scoped under `<root>/buckets/<bucket-id>/`. The "
"bucket contains `db/cadrumo.db`, encrypted blobs, audit material, "
"`manifest.toml`, `.lock`, and an output-language hint. Key material is "
"rooted under `<root>/keystore/<bucket-id>/`. Tokens, logs, secrets, "
"blobs, and audit paths derive from the same product root unless an "
"explicit Cadrumo setting overrides them."
msgstr ""
"El estado del perfil está delimitado por bucket en `<root>/buckets"
"/<bucket-id>/`. El bucket contiene `db/cadrumo.db`, blobs cifrados, "
"material de auditoría, `manifest.toml`, `.lock` y una pista del idioma de"
" salida. El material de claves se aloja en `<root>/keystore/<bucket-"
"id>/`. Los tokens, los registros, los secretos, los blobs y las rutas de "
"auditoría derivan de la misma raíz del producto, salvo que un ajuste "
"explícito de Cadrumo los sobrescriba."

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:33
msgid ""
"Google Drive mirroring uses a Cadrumo-owned `cadrumo-vault/` folder. A "
"former `aeat-vault/` folder is not adopted."
msgstr ""
"La réplica en Google Drive usa una carpeta `cadrumo-vault/` propiedad de "
"Cadrumo. Una antigua carpeta `aeat-vault/` no se adopta."

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:36
msgid "Old `aeat`-named storage is refused, not migrated"
msgstr "El almacenamiento antiguo con nombre `aeat` se rechaza, no se migra"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:38
msgid ""
"Cadrumo refuses recognizable former product state. This includes a "
"sibling `aeat` application-state directory, an `aeat.db` database, "
"`aeat.*`, `aeat-test.*`, or `aeat-tests.*` secure-object namespaces, and "
"former bundle or Drive-folder names."
msgstr ""
"Cadrumo rechaza el estado reconocible de un producto anterior. Esto "
"incluye un directorio hermano de estado de aplicación `aeat`, una base de"
" datos `aeat.db`, los espacios de nombres de objetos seguros `aeat.*`, "
"`aeat-test.*` o `aeat-tests.*`, y antiguos nombres de bundle o de carpeta"
" de Drive."

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:43
msgid ""
"The refusal is non-destructive. Cadrumo does not read, connect to, copy, "
"move, re-key, delete, migrate, or adopt that state. Detection leaves the "
"former bytes untouched and requires the operator to choose a separate, "
"explicit disposition."
msgstr ""
"El rechazo no es destructivo. Cadrumo no lee, ni se conecta, ni copia, ni"
" mueve, ni recifra, ni borra, ni migra, ni adopta ese estado. La "
"detección deja intactos los bytes antiguos y exige que el operador elija "
"una disposición aparte y explícita."

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:47
msgid "Safety and filing scope"
msgstr "Alcance de seguridad y de presentación"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Surface"
msgstr "Superficie"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Cadrumo behavior"
msgstr "Comportamiento de Cadrumo"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Calculation and verification"
msgstr "Cálculo y verificación"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Local; evaluates saved records against bundled registry rules and evidence"
msgstr ""
"Local; evalúa los registros guardados frente a las reglas del registro "
"incluidas y la evidencia"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Export"
msgstr "Exportación"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid ""
"Writes an AEAT-compatible local file after verification and required "
"evidence gates pass; portal acceptance is not guaranteed"
msgstr ""
"Escribe un fichero local compatible con la AEAT después de que se superen"
" la verificación y las comprobaciones de evidencia obligatorias; no se "
"garantiza la aceptación en el portal"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Live AEAT access"
msgstr "Acceso en vivo a la AEAT"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Separately invoked, authenticated, and read-only"
msgstr "Se invoca por separado, autenticado y de solo lectura"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Submission"
msgstr "Presentación"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Forbidden; no Cadrumo submission command exists"
msgstr "Prohibida; no existe ningún comando de presentación en Cadrumo"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Official filing"
msgstr "Presentación oficial"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Performed by a human through an official AEAT channel"
msgstr "La realiza una persona a través de un canal oficial de la AEAT"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Filing history"
msgstr "Historial de presentaciones"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid ""
"Recorded locally after the human filing; reconciliation compares totals "
"and, for enrolled modelos, captured per-casilla values"
msgstr ""
"Se registra localmente después de la presentación por la persona; la "
"conciliación compara los totales y, para los modelos inscritos, los "
"valores capturados por casilla"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "Responsabilidad"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md
msgid ""
"The taxpayer or authorized filer reviews figures, meets deadlines, "
"uploads, and retains the justificante"
msgstr ""
"El contribuyente o el presentador autorizado revisa las cifras, cumple "
"los plazos, sube el fichero y conserva el justificante"

#: Y:/code/aeat-worktrees/main/docs/reference/filesystem-state-and-safety.md:59
msgid ""
"See [Protect access to your data](../how-to/protect-data-access.md) for "
"recovery, locking, export, and reset tasks. The [filing-boundary "
"explanation](../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md) "
"explains why submission stays outside Cadrumo."
msgstr ""
"Consulta [Protege el acceso a tus datos](../how-to/protect-data-"
"access.md) para las tareas de recuperación, bloqueo, exportación y "
"restablecimiento. La [explicación del límite de "
"presentación](../explanation/recording-a-filing-and-the-boundary.md) "
"explica por qué la presentación queda fuera de Cadrumo."

